<main class="legal-page">
  <h1>About GymButler</h1>
  
  <p>
    GymButler is a free, all-in-one gym companion app built to help you train smarter. 
    Whether you're calculating working percentages, converting between kilograms and pounds, 
    or timing your rest intervals, GymButler has you covered.
  </p>
  
  <h2>Features</h2>
  
  <h3>Weight Percentages</h3>
  <p>
    Enter your working weight and instantly see all your training percentages. 
    Customize the minimum, maximum, and step values to match your training program.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Weight Converter</h3>
  <p>
    Quickly convert between kilograms and pounds with a simple tap. Includes a handy 
    trick: divide by 2, then subtract 10% for a quick mental conversion.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Timer</h3>
  <p>
    Set custom countdown timers with round tracking. Perfect for interval training, 
    with automatic tracking of your best, worst, and average round times.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Stopwatch</h3>
  <p>
    Track your rest times with lap functionality. View detailed statistics including 
    average, best, and worst lap times to optimize your training.
  </p>
  
